{"seq":1,"slug":"web-scraping","title":"Web 爬虫与数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-data-engineering/data-collection-cleaning/web-scraping","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-爬虫与数据采集\">Web 爬虫与数据采集</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Web 爬虫与数据采集是 AI 数据工程的第一个环节，负责从互联网和各种数据源中获取原始数据。在 AI/ML 项目中，高质量的训练数据往往决定了模型效果的天花板。数据采集不仅仅是&quot;下载网页&quot;那么简单，它涉及反爬对抗、增量采集、分布式调度和数据质量初筛等系统性工程问题。2023 年以来，生成式 AI 重塑了抓取生态：OpenAI GPTBot 等 AI 爬虫通过 robots.txt 专属 token 与站长协商抓取授权，站点侧的 AI 反抓取管理成为新常态；采集目标也从页面字段转向 LLM 可用的训练语料，Markdown 化采集与 LLM 结构化抽取成为与传统 CSS/XPath 解析并列的主流路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据需求定义] --&gt; B[数据源识别]&#10;    B --&gt; C[采集策略设计]&#10;    C --&gt; D[爬虫开发]&#10;    D --&gt; E[反爬对抗]&#10;    E --&gt; F[数据提取]&#10;    F --&gt; G[质量初筛]&#10;    G --&gt; H[存储入库]&#10;    H --&gt; I[增量更新]&#10;    I --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[数据需求定义] --&gt; B[数据源识别]\n    B --&gt; C[采集策略设计]\n    C --&gt; D[爬虫开发]\n    D --&gt; E[反爬对抗]\n    E --&gt; F[数据提取]\n    F --&gt; G[质量初筛]\n    G --&gt; H[存储入库]\n    H --&gt; I[增量更新]\n    I --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>手动采集</th>\n<th>单机爬虫</th>\n<th>分布式爬虫</th>\n<th>第三方数据服务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据规模</td>\n<td>百级</td>\n<td>万级</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>取决于服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采集速度</td>\n<td>极慢</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术成本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（付费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据质量</td>\n<td>高（人工筛选）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规风险</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（合同约束）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>概念验证</td>\n<td>中小型项目</td>\n<td>大规模训练集</td>\n<td>商业数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据采集的核心原则是：在法律和道德框架内，以最高效率获取最高质量的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爬虫架构设计\">爬虫架构设计</h2><p>一个生产级爬虫系统需要模块化的架构设计，各组件职责清晰且可独立扩展。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CrawlerConfig {&#10;  seeds: string[];&#10;  maxDepth: number;&#10;  maxConcurrency: number;&#10;  requestInterval: number;&#10;  userAgent: string;&#10;  respectRobotsTxt: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CrawlTask {&#10;  url: string;&#10;  depth: number;&#10;  priority: number;&#10;  retryCount: number;&#10;  metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CrawlResult {&#10;  url: string;&#10;  statusCode: number;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  extractedData: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  links: string[];&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CrawlerModule {&#10;  scheduler: TaskScheduler;&#10;  downloader: PageDownloader;&#10;  parser: ContentParser;&#10;  storage: DataStorage;&#10;  monitor: CrawlMonitor;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  seeds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxConcurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requestInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userAgent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  respectRobotsTxt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retryCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statusCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  extractedData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  links</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlerModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scheduler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskScheduler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  downloader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PageDownloader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  storage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataStorage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monitor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[URL 调度器] --&gt; B[下载器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[解析器]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据存储]&#10;    C --&gt; E[链接提取]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    F[去重过滤器] --&gt; A&#10;    G[监控系统] --&gt; A&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    A[URL 调度器] --&gt; B[下载器]\n    B --&gt; C[解析器]\n    C --&gt; D[数据存储]\n    C --&gt; E[链接提取]\n    E --&gt; A\n    F[去重过滤器] --&gt; A\n    G[监控系统] --&gt; A\n    G --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; D</pre><p>关键组件设计要点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调度器</td>\n<td>URL 优先级队列、去重</td>\n<td>布隆过滤器、优先队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下载器</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求、渲染</td>\n<td>连接池、无头浏览器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析器</td>\n<td>内容提取、结构化</td>\n<td>CSS 选择器、XPath、正则、LLM 抽取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>持久化和索引</td>\n<td>文件系统、数据库、对象存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控</td>\n<td>进度追踪、异常告警</td>\n<td>指标采集、日志分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反爬对抗策略\">反爬对抗策略</h2><p>现代网站部署了多层反爬机制，爬虫需要针对性地应对。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反爬机制</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>应对策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>User-Agent 检测</td>\n<td>头部字段分析</td>\n<td>轮换真实浏览器 UA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 频率限制</td>\n<td>请求频率统计</td>\n<td>代理池 + 请求间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cookie/Session</td>\n<td>会话状态验证</td>\n<td>模拟登录、Session 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JavaScript 渲染</td>\n<td>检测 JS 执行</td>\n<td>无头浏览器（Playwright）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证码</td>\n<td>人机验证</td>\n<td>OCR 识别、打码服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜜罐链接</td>\n<td>隐藏链接陷阱</td>\n<td>CSS 可见性检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProxyConfig {&#10;  pool: string[];&#10;  rotationStrategy: &#39;round-robin&#39; | &#39;random&#39; | &#39;least-used&#39;;&#10;  healthCheckInterval: number;&#10;  maxFailures: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createRequestWithRetry = async (&#10;  url: string,&#10;  config: CrawlerConfig,&#10;  proxyConfig: ProxyConfig,&#10;): Promise&lt;CrawlResult&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const maxRetries = 3;&#10;&#10;  for (let attempt = 0; attempt &lt; maxRetries; attempt++) {&#10;    const proxy = selectProxy(proxyConfig);&#10;    const delay = config.requestInterval * (1 + Math.random() * 0.5);&#10;    await sleep(delay);&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;      const response = await fetch(url, {&#10;        headers: {&#10;          &#39;User-Agent&#39;: getRandomUA(),&#10;          &#39;Accept-Language&#39;: &#39;zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en;q=0.8&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      });&#10;&#10;      if (response.status === 429) {&#10;        await sleep(delay * Math.pow(2, attempt));&#10;        continue;&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      return parseResponse(url, response);&#10;    } catch {&#10;      markProxyFailed(proxy, proxyConfig);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  throw new Error(`Failed to crawl ${url} after ${maxRetries} attempts`);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProxyConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rotationStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'round-robin'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'random'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'least-used'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  healthCheckInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxFailures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createRequestWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrawlerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  proxyConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProxyConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CrawlResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#2